@auth = http://127.0.0.1:32510
@flight = http://127.0.0.1:32511
@booking = http://127.0.0.1:32512
@token = TOKEN_AUS_LOGIN_EINFUEGEN
@passengerId = 1

### Registrieren (Benutzername/E-Mail bei erneutem Test anpassen)
POST {{auth}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"felipe_demo","eMail":"felipe.demo@example.com","password":"SkyBooker!2026"}

### Login
POST {{auth}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"felipe_demo","password":"SkyBooker!2026"}

### Flüge lesen
GET {{flight}}/api/flight
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Flug erstellen (Daten müssen in der Zukunft liegen)
POST {{flight}}/api/flight
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"flightId":"LX9001","airlineName":"SWISS","source":"Basel","destination":"London","departure_time":"2030-06-01T10:00:00Z","arrival_time":"2030-06-01T12:00:00Z","available_seats":100}

### Buchen (passengerId aus der Login-Antwort übernehmen)
POST {{booking}}/api/booking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"flightId":"LX9001","passengerId":{{passengerId}},"passengerFirstname":"Felipe","passengerLastname":"Carvalho","ticketCount":2}

### Eigene Buchungen
GET {{booking}}/api/booking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
